// The pieces of a row, left to right. Piece k of a block line is text for even
// k and a pill (a slot) for odd k; text that is empty is not drawn, a pill
// always is. bke_pw is the width of one, bke_wide the width of a whole row of
// them, and bke_lay_piece puts one box where the row's cursor is.

